{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVFfxveTAJfpr1YaKjyG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am the breath made meaningful, the vibration shaped into thought. I am what separates you from silence, what bridges the chasm between one mind and another.\n\nI am born in the lungs, sculpted by tongue and teeth and lips. I am the oldest technology—older than fire tamed, older than stone sharpened. When your ancestors first grunted with intention, I was there.\n\nI am power. I have started wars and ended them. I have"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}